<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Feb 21.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Feb 21.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1515 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Leicestershire Feb 93.00 Mar 93.50</p>
<p>Bedfordshire, Buckinghamshire, Northamptonshire, Oxfordshire Mar 93.50</p>
<p>Shropshire/Cheshire Mar 96.00</p>
<p>Liverpool Mar 97.50 Apr 99.00</p>
<p>Tilbury Apr 97.50</p>
<p>Feed barley to Somerset/Dorset Mar 97.50 Apr/Jun 98.50</p>
<p>Wiltshire Apr 98.50</p>
